  "observations": [
    "C3 Expo São Paulo: both children up to age 10 enter free with ticketed guardian. Standard adult BRL 130 / 160 / 110, or 270 for three days. Solidarity prices require a food donation. High Score and Battle Coliseum have separate eligibility and fee rules.",
    "Battle Coliseum specific page says 12 November while general C3 FAQ says 16 November. Start.gg embedded eventRegistrationClosesAt=1794798000 resolves to 16 November 00:00 Sao Paulo time. Earlier dedicated page date and general platform close differ; no resolved per-bracket deadline is exported.",
    "CTWC Brazil tour lists 20–22 November, local arena lists 20 November free play, 21 qualification and 22 playoffs. BRL 25 is a projected on-site fee. Only 21–22 are competition days. Four other November tour stops were checked individually. January and April headline cards were not assigned to 2027 because the linked details show earlier 2026 editions.",
    "Game Expo Rio: one child through age 6 free per paying adult, age 7–15 requires a ticket and legal adult accompaniment, proof of age. Seller price lots unavailable in readback. Pokémon TCG, Street Fighter II X and Fatal Fury are separate games with separate entry; age and any specific tournament fee remain open.",
    "Jahu Game Show offers free family admission and optional food donation. The WCA tournament permits every age and nationality with legal guardian for minors, has 40 places, BRL 30 advance / BRL 40 on site if available, and verified online cutoff 10 November at 23:59 local.",
    "FestiGame family access from age 2 is paid. Fever promo was CLP 12 900 for one or CLP 38 700 for four for one day. Organizer opening 11:00 differs from a Fever selector showing 10:00. Watch Party is separate and age terms for it remain unknown.",
    "LEVEL UY public Expo differs from the professional workshops and closed CONAVI project contest. Local CONAVI categories require Uruguayan residency and ID or local entity, with an international-category exception; no age floor in FAQ. Individual and team submission both possible in the completed window.",
    "Cali festival and TNE moved to March 2027 with dates pending. TNE offers independent two-layer PCB design and embedded gesture recognition challenges. No age, exact deadline, published ticket price or confirmed admission.",
    "Game Fest Minas 2026 is cancelled in organizer notice at the ticket seller, even though prior dates remain in the header. No live dates or calendar event.",
    "Sesc Bom Retiro publishes eight remaining Sunday voxel fabrication workshops and Sesc Consolação eleven remaining Inventatório dates. Both are free. The latter is recommended through age 6; admission for older children not confirmed. No ES or EN instruction inferred.",
    "CTIC-UNI posted four age 9–12 junior workshop pages, but dates without year conflict with claimed weekdays if assigned to 2027 and the terms cite 2026. Four undated watch dossiers only. Programable, Astranautas, Troonic and Minds of Tomorrow Paraguay were already covered and not duplicated.",
    "WRO Panamá 12 regional dates were rechecked against roadmap and portal and retained. The 16 listed MEDUCA administrative regions are distinct from the 12 competitions. Argentina Game Show remains a watch. The Peru Comic Con organizer site remains on an older edition and no current seller terms were available in this pass."
  ]
